## 📋 Endpoint Matrix & Gap Analysis

### 1. Frontend-Only Endpoints
**None.** Every API route called by the frontend `trackers.service.ts` corresponds to an active and functioning NestJS route in the backend.

### 2. Backend-Only Endpoints (Not yet utilized in Frontend)
These endpoints exist on the backend but are not called by the current frontend `trackers.service.ts`:
| Endpoint | Method | Purpose | Response Format |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `/api/v1/conversation-intelligence/trackers/detections` | `GET` | Retrieve all keyword detections for the tenant. | `{ data: Array<M02TrackerDetection> }` |
| `/api/v1/conversation-intelligence/trackers/detections/:entityId` | `GET` | Get detections for a specific call/email transcript. | `{ data: Array<M02TrackerDetection> }` |
| `/api/v1/conversation-intelligence/trackers/:trackerId/detail` | `GET` | Get computed dashboard metrics (top reps/accounts) for a tracker slug. | `{ data: { percentage: number, mentions: number, topAccounts: string[], topReps: string[], aiInsight: string } }` |
| `/api/v1/conversation-intelligence/trackers/:trackerId/ask` | `POST` | Ask a question about mentions context. | `{ data: { answer: string } }` |

